      "message": "feat(teams): FileConsent and Graph SharePoint channel files\n\nPersonal 1:1 chats send/receive files via native FileConsent cards.\nChannel and group chats inline small text; other files upload to the\nconversation filesFolder through Microsoft Graph / SharePoint, then\npost a clickable link. Inbound HTML-only channel drops GET the Graph\nmessage and download SharePoint attachments.\n\nAlso stores unmentioned channel/group posts as observed context when\nRSC + require_mention are on (needed so inbound files and chatter\nshare the same message-read path).\n\nStacked on cursor/feat-teams-reactions-9eb4 so reaction review is not\nduplicated.\n\nCo-authored-by: tournierjc <tournierjc@users.noreply.github.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "499e6a95e4ab730caaf6c13770b7f36e01c576a9",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/499e6a95e4ab730caaf6c13770b7f36e01c576a9"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/bf5cbbad7e6956ae7024e808684ebe549a1320df",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLE0+MN5+pO/txMil6atre4nqUPbj80f88fEKfK6CB9fh9bHsiv9jWdtlfKZpEKMCD\nnp34edsiHaGQtC8wXVzQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
