      "message": "feat(teams): stream replies via Bot Framework activity updates\n\nImplement edit_message using conversations.activities.update (same client\nas FileConsent activities.delete), flatten ;messageid= conversation ids,\ncoalesce identical mid-stream edits, and fall back to a plain send when\nupdates are unsupported. Keep draft_stream_is_message off.\n\nCo-authored-by: tournierjc <tournierjc@users.noreply.github.com>",
